              Quick Management
            </h3>
          </div>

          <div style="padding: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;">
            <!-- Kalash Yatra -->
            <a href="/admin/kalash-yatra" class="dash-quick-action" style="background: #fff7ed; color: #c2410c; border-color: #fed7aa;">
              <div class="dash-quick-icon" style="background: #ffedd5; color: #ea580c;">
                🚩
              </div>
              <div style="flex: 1;">
                <div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800;">संकल्प यात्रा हब (Kalash Yatra)</div>
